是一个说故事秀
It's a storytelling show.

103
00:04:32,340 --> 00:04:34,160
人们诉说他们个人的故事
People telling their personal stories.

104
00:04:34,340 --> 00:04:36,620
基本上就是个有趣的方式
It's basically a fun way to find out

105
