老娘绝对要把40块捞回来
Well, I'm getting that $40 back.

122
00:05:32,860 --> 00:05:35,360
我今晚花的钱 比2013一整年还多
I spent more money tonight than I did in 2013.

123
00:05:37,140 --> 00:05:39,100
当时是我高中的一场舞会
It was a high school dance,

124
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:42,280
瑞秋·穆尼 人见人爱的校花
and Rachel Mooney, a popular girl,

125
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,580
当众扒我裤子整我
pulled down my pants.

126
00:05:45,220 --> 00:05:45,835
没错
That's right.

127
00:05:45,835 --> 00:05:48,780
我被人跳舞扒裤恶整了
I got dance-pantsed.

128
00:05:48,780 --> 00:05:51,340
这男的从汤姆·克鲁斯
Oh, this guy just went from Tom Cruise

129
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:52,700
变成汤姆·睡死死了
to Tom Snooze.

130
00:05:53,660 --> 00:05:55,340
最后 我学到了
In the end, what I learned

131
00:05:55,340 --> 00:05:58,400
我才是我人生这幅画的画家
is that I'm the painter of my life,

132
00:05:58,900 --> 00:06:01,740
我可以把我不想看到的部分涂掉
and I can paint out what I don't want to see.

133
00:06:02,580 --> 00:06:03,980
我的画笔由我操控
My brushes are mine.

134
00:06:03,980 --> 00:06:06,240
每一笔刷都由我做主
My strokes are mine.

135
00:06:08,100 --> 00:06:10,190
猜猜谁裤裆里的"画笔"今晚不会被"操"控
Guess what's not getting stroked tonight.

136
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:14,960
亚当老兄的"画笔"
Old Adam's paintbrush.

137
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:23,620
这鼓掌绝对是带讽刺性吧
That's got to be sarcastic applauding, right?

138
00:06:23,700 --> 00:06:25,260
因为我觉得每一声掌声的尾音
'Cause I feel like I heard, like, a question mark

139
00:06:25,260 --> 00:06:26,060
都带着问号
at the end of the clap.

140
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,700
谢谢 亚当·奥古斯特
Thank you, Adam August.

141
00:06:29,500 --> 00:06:30,780
现在到了节目的尾声
That is the end of our show.

142
00:06:30,860 --> 00:06:32,540
我想谢谢所有的表演者
I'd like to thank all of our performers.

143
00:06:33,420 --> 00:06:37,140
活出你的人生 做你独家听众
You live the stories that we live to hear.

144
00:06:39,220 --> 00:06:39,920
卡洛琳
Hey, Caroline.

145
00:06:40,340 --> 00:06:43,040
我知道 挺震撼挺真
I know, that was pretty real.

146
00:06:44,900 --> 00:06:46,260
真得很又臭又长
It was real long.

147
00:06:47,500 --> 00:06:48,920
所以我们去哪里吃晚饭
So where are we going for dinner?

148
00:06:49,100 --> 00:06:50,460
你来请客 她一起来
Your treat, and she's coming.

149
00:06:51,660 --> 00:06:54,500
我今晚情绪上已经耗光 累了
Actually, I'm pretty spent emotionally.

150
00:06:55,460 --> 00:06:57,220
我们金钱上也耗了40块呢
Well, we're spent forty-dollars-ally.

151
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:01,560
今晚大概就是属于那种
It's just one of those nights where...

152
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:03,500
把一切都散尽在台上的夜晚
you leave it all on the stage.

153
00:07:04,620 --> 00:07:06,640
你有没有刚好散几张20块在台上呢
You happen to leave a couple twenties up there?

154
