"贫民凯莉"笑话
"Pariah Carey" Joke.

349
00:16:04,660 --> 00:16:06,820
我是在给她保驾护航好吗
Just looking out for my girl here.

350
00:16:10,380 --> 00:16:13,300
我的完美世界瞬间坍塌
My perfect world was shattered.

351
00:16:14,260 --> 00:16:16,720
我看见那个我曾信任的男人
I saw the man who I trusted,

352
00:16:17,300 --> 00:16:20,140
全世界我最信任的男人
who I believed in more than anyone,

353
00:16:20,140 --> 00:16:23,220
那个会给我念睡前故事
who read me bedtime stories

354
00:16:23,860 --> 00:16:25,880
用童趣的方式教我系鞋带的男人
and taught me how to tie my shoes with bunny ears...

355
00:16:27,100 --> 00:16:29,160
我看见我父亲戴着手铐
I saw my father in handcuffs.

356
00:16:30,260 --> 00:16:32,000
他偷走了我的信任
He stole my trust,

357
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:34,000
我对人的信任
my belief in people,

358
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:35,060
我的单纯天真
my innocence.

359
00:16:35,660 --> 00:16:37,900
如果她不说"纯洁[童贞]"这个词 我就走人了
If she doesn't say "virginity," I am leaving.

360
00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:42,000
他偷走了那个我想象中的自己
He stole who I thought I was

361
00:16:42,700 --> 00:16:46,280
让我去寻找 真正的自己
and left me to find who I really am.

362
00:16:48,160 --> 00:16:49,380
谢谢大家
Thank you.

363
00:16:51,940 --> 00:16:52,898
没反应吗
Nothing?

364
00:16:52,898 --> 00:16:55,463
我们得偷偷把她弄到后门溜走
We got to sneak her out the back door.

365
00:17:07,050 --> 00:17:10,740
你刚讲得又悲伤又成功
You were so sad and triumphant

366
00:17:10,740 --> 00:17:13,070
而且还...
and... so...

367
00:17:13,780 --> 00:17:16,211
我要飙泪了
Oh, here come the waterworks!

368
00:17:17,900 --> 00:17:18,560
卡洛琳
Caroline,

369
00:17:18,560 --> 00:17:20,560
你说过你永远不会这么做
I know you said you never would,

370
00:17:21,360 --> 00:17:22,760
但你感动[摸]了我
but you touched me.

371
00:17:25,580 --> 00:17:28,100
你的故事触动了我的心弦
That really tugged at my heartstrings...

372
00:17:29,060 --> 00:17:30,120
或电线 管线
or cables or wires

373
00:17:30,120 --> 00:17:32,260
反正是里面那个让我活着的东西
or whatever's in here keeping me alive.

374
00:17:34,260 --> 00:17:34,920
卡洛琳
Caroline...

375
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:39,400
你知道我和你都需要什么吗
Oh, you know what you and I both need?

376
00:17:39,980 --> 00:17:42,260
爱的抱抱
A hug. Yeah.

377
00:17:46,900 --> 00:17:48,620
感觉很好吧
It's nice, isn't it?

378
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:52,880
卡洛琳 刚才太棒了
Caroline, that was great!

379
00:17:53,100 --> 00:17:56,520
很高兴我能用我了不起的故事激励你
I'm so glad I inspired you with my awesome story.

380
00:17:57,340 --> 00:17:58,560
你怎么还在这儿啊
You're still here?

381
00:18:00,820 --> 00:18:03,300
抱歉我没有讲你的笑话 麦克斯
I'm sorry I didn't do your jokes, Max.

382
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:05,440
算了 你根本不需要
You know what? You didn't need them!

383
00:18:05,740 --> 00:18:07,920
我觉得人们有时候喜欢悲伤
I think people sometimes like to be sad.

384
00:18:08,280 --> 00:18:09,300
所以阿黛尔才这么红
That's why there's Adele.

385
00:18:11,580 --> 00:18:13,500
我觉得我终于解脱了
I think I finally got closure.

386
00:18:13,800 --> 00:18:14,820
过去了 麦克斯
It's gone, Max.

387
00:18:15,840 --> 00:18:16,920
爱你
Love you.

388
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:18,360
爱你的故事
Love your story.

389
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:19,440
谢谢
Thanks.

390
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:20,760
我是妮娜·施皮格尔
I'm Nina Spiegel.

391
00:18:21,080 --> 00:18:22,560
我觉得这故事引人入胜
I found the whole thing riveting.

392
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:24,560
起起落落 跌落谷底
The ups, the downs, the way-downs.

393
00:18:25,700 --> 00:18:27,340
你的故事真是一应俱全
Ugh, your story had it all.

394
00:18:27,580 --> 00:18:29,100
她不会跟你玩3P的
She's not joining your threesome.

395
00:18:31,320 --> 00:18:33,920
抱歉 通常有女人夸我都是因为想玩3P
Sorry, that's usually what women want when they compliment me.

396
00:18:34,700 --> 00:18:37,160
我想谈谈把这故事带去我的制片厂[公寓]
Look, I'd like to talk about taking this to my studio.

397
00:18:37,620 --> 00:18:39,460
你还有自己的小公寓吗
You have your own studio apartment?

398
00:18:41,120 --> 00:18:42,620
让欢呼继续
Let the wooing continue.

399
00:18:43,180 --> 00:18:44,920
不 那是电影制片厂
No, it's a film studio.

400
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:46,160
华纳兄弟
Warner Brothers.

401
00:18:47,060 --> 00:18:49,240
拍《大嘴怪》的那个华纳兄弟吗
The Tasmanian Devil Warner Brothers?

402
00:18:51,180 --> 00:18:54,140
我觉得我们能将你的故事变成电影
I think we can turn your story into a movie.

403
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:55,240
真的吗
Really?

404
00:18:55,980 --> 00:18:57,740
卡洛琳·钱宁传奇故事
The Caroline Channing story

405
00:18:57,740 --> 00:18:59,440
理应能在大荧幕上
deserves to live on the big screen

406
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:00,740
存活一到两周
for one to two weeks.

407
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:03,200
然后永远待在电视点播里
Then On Demand for eternity.

408
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:06,620
老天
Oh, my God.

409
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:08,820
麦克斯 这太让人激动了
Max, isn't this exciting?

410
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:09,820
我知道
I know!

411
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:12,480
墨西哥飛毛腿鼠也是他们公司的
They have Speedy Gonzalez too!

412
00:19:17,600 --> 00:19:19,300
我还在等 麦克斯
I'm still on hold, Max.

413
00:19:19,520 --> 00:19:20,600
我知道妮娜是个大人物
I know Nina's important,

414
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:22,960
因为她的助手让我等了六次
because her assistant has put me on hold six times

415
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:24,140
静音了我两次
and muted me twice.

416
00:19:25,500 --> 00:19:26,400
还可以静音你吗
Muting you's an option?

417
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:28,920
他们怎么不在你的说明书里写上
Why wouldn't they put that in your manual?

418
00:19:30,020 --> 00:19:30,560
你好
Hi!

419
00:19:31,080 --> 00:19:32,220
开什么玩笑
Oh, are you kidding?

420
00:19:32,280 --> 00:19:33,540
我最爱等[端盘子]了
I love waiting.

421
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:38,080
苏菲 这是你的安慰汤圆
Sophie, here's your consolation gnocchi,

422
00:19:38,080 --> 00:19:40,860
来"安慰"你没找到代孕妈妈
for not finding somebody to get gn-knocked up.

423
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:43,920
谢谢 奥列格
Oh, thanks, Oleg.

424
00:19:44,580 --> 00:19:47,980
至少我还有你
Well, at least I have you.

425
00:19:49,680 --> 00:19:51,000
算了 苏菲
You know what, Sophie?

426
00:19:51,500 --> 00:19:52,720
我来帮你代孕吧
I'll be the surrogate,

427
00:19:52,740 --> 00:19:54,800
但如果怀孕了 我奶涨到撞倒路灯
but if my pregnancy boobs knock over a street lamp,

428
00:19:54,800 --> 00:19:55,820
那得算在你的保险账上
that's on your insurance.

429
00:19:56,620 --> 00:19:58,620
谢谢你的好意 麦克斯
That's real nice of you, Max,

430
00:19:58,620 --> 00:20:02,220
但如果说我从卡洛琳的故事学到什么的话
but if there's anything that I learned from Caroline's story,

431
00:20:02,220 --> 00:20:06,040
就是不能放弃 即使到了应该放弃的地步
it's that you can't give up, even if you should.

432
00:20:07,300 --> 00:20:08,560
所以你们要继续努力造人吗
Oh, so you're gonna keep trying?

433
00:20:08,740 --> 00:20:10,360
不 我们要领养
No, we're gonna adopt,

434
00:20:10,420 --> 00:20:12,460
我们会珍惜这个小宝宝
and we will cherish this little baby,

435
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:15,100
就算它不是我们亲生的
even if it's not technically from us.

436
00:20:15,300 --> 00:20:16,460
对 奥列格说得对
Yeah, Oleg's right.

437
00:20:16,900 --> 00:20:19,760
我有一半头发也不是我自己的
I mean, half my hair's not from me,

438
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:22,900
但我对它们视如己出 爱护有加
but I love it just as much as if it were.

439
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:28,520
他们要我飞去好莱坞
They are flying me to Hollywood!

440
00:20:28,820 --> 00:20:30,442
他们想我坐头等舱
They want to bring me out first class

441
00:20:30,442 --> 00:20:31,420
去参加见面会
for a meet-and-greet.

442
00:20:31,420 --> 00:20:32,540
但我拒绝了
But I told them no.

443
00:20:33,300 --> 00:20:34,200
你疯了吗
Are you crazy?

444
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:35,640
你不能拒绝见面会
You can't pass up a meet-and-greet.

445
00:20:36,360 --> 00:20:37,600
你不能拒绝任何肉[谐音]
You can't pass up any kind of meat.

446
00:20:37,820 --> 00:20:38,340
你贫血好吗
You're anemic.

447
00:20:39,620 --> 00:20:41,680
我换成了两张经济舱机票
I switched the tickets for two coach seats.

448
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:43,040
我想你跟我一起去
I want you to come with me!

449
00:20:43,300 --> 00:20:44,300
谁稀罕能平躺的座位
Who needs to lie flat

450
00:20:44,300 --> 00:20:46,020
我只想跟我的闺蜜和一个胖犹太人
when I can be squished between my best friend

451
00:20:46,020 --> 00:20:47,940
挤在飞机的36排
and an obese rabbi in row 36?

452
00:20:49,140 --> 00:20:50,360
我们要去好莱坞啦
We're going to Hollywood!
